            "category": "site",
            "title": "Hack Forums under maintenance",
            "description": "On September the 18th our administrator Omniscient announced that he was working on a server which was causing HF to crash multiple times this past week. After a good few hours of researching what was causing the crashes Omniscient discovered that the recent crashes were probably due to a broken SSD drive in the RAID configuration. In the upcoming few days this is most likely going to be fixed by the hosting company.",
            "url": "http://hackforums.net/showthread.php?tid=5409220",
            "users": []
        },
        {
            "category": "site",
            "title": "New Prestige requirement in Counter Strike forum",
            "description": "Two days ago Omniscient announced that members are now required to have atleast 25 prestige to post in the Counter Strike forum. This new requirement was added in an attempt to reduce the amount of trolling and LQ posts. If you're upgraded into L33T or UB3R (not 3P1C) this requirement is bypassed. >>Source http://i.imgur.com/W4AjjOA.png",
            "url": "http://hackforums.net/showthread.php?tid=5408230",
            "users": []
